Just thought I would resolve a few lingering mysteries and right a couple of
wrongs.
	First off, several people have told the fellow who met Juiblex on level
2 that he found a bones level...but there are no bones level 2's...thus, the
only possible solution is that he summoned a water demon, which gated in
Juiblex by a stroke of extreme misfortune...or, there was a polymorph trap
in the room with the stairs (though I don't know if monsters can get
polymorphed into demon lords; I would think not).
	Also, one gentleman wondered why the shopkeeper stolidly stood by his
doorway while being pounded to death...the shopkeeper, when he can't see
where you are in his shop, always blocks the door, no matter what else happens;
this occurence is unconnected to the other guy who found empty shops, or
keepers outside their stores...THAT sounds like a bug, or maybe that he had
robbed a shop and then forgotten about it, or that a potent pet of his had
killed them off one by one.





